<Mod id="991b478d-3f9d-4de2-a021-150fa63b800d" version="1">
  <Properties>
    <Name>The Last City — Humanity's Final Refuge</Name>
    <Teaser>When the world fell, one city refused to die.</Teaser>
    <Description>One-city survival, refugees, provisions, rationing, morale, invasions and the Sanctuary Council. Requires BNW and Community Patch v151.</Description>
